Oh  well it's me again thanks to all you  wonderful people two days ago I was able  to upload a 10,000 subscriber thank you  video  now here we are sitting at over fifty  thousand with this huge boost in new  viewers I'm finally able to start  considering making YouTube my full-time  occupation it won't be easy but I'm sure  that with the help of the amazing second  thought family we can make it a reality  a few people have already reached out to  me asking how they can donate to help  fund new videos and that's why I'm here  today  I'm officially launching a patreon page  for second thought your support on  patreon will help me devote more time to  making videos and hopefully allow me to  upload more often making these videos is  very time consuming and unfortunately  YouTube ad revenue doesn't quite cover  the time I spend making them that's  where you come in check out the patron  rewards for each donation amount on my  page at patreon.com slash second thought  thank you all so much for your continued  support  [Music]

